  "remediationSummary": "No HIGH finding is accepted any more, and the exception register is empty. The 7 braces-chain findings that revision 1 accepted temporarily until 2026-11-02 are NOT fixed: braces 3.0.3, micromatch, chokidar, fast-glob, tailwindcss 3.4.17, @next/eslint-plugin-next and eslint-config-next 15.5.19 are unchanged in the lockfile. They left the audit only because the root advisory GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm was withdrawn from the GitHub Advisory Database on 2026-10-23, so the gate reported their exceptions as STALE_OR_ORPHANED_EXCEPTION and they were deleted with the owner's approval; if a real advisory reaches these packages again it fails as an ordinary UNAPPROVED_HIGH. Separately, three live HIGH findings were cleared by in-range lockfile updates: zod 4.4.3 to 4.6.7 (production), undici 7.30.0 to 7.30.1 and vitest's vite 8.0.16 to 8.3.5 (dev). Production dependencies carry 0 critical and 0 high; the full tree carries 0 critical and 0 high. Moderate findings remain visible and non-blocking."
